      "role": "user",
      "content": "i checked the sheet name and it definitely says Recon_Report exactly. no typos there. i also tried unprotecting everything but i'm still getting the same 1004 error. could it be something else? maybe a problem with how the range is being defined?",
      "source": "evaluator"
